## Item DB
- format: JSON file
- sample DB:
  - {"itemID_1": {
        "name": "itemName",
        "description": "description of item",
        "craftable": true/false,
        "imagePath": "the file path of the image of the item"
        },

     "itemID_2": {...}
    }
- TODO: add image path once we have it for crafted items.

## Room DB
- Note: only serves as the room inventory for the game, isUnlocked is not saved in DB since it's user-specific
- format: JSON file
- sample DB:
  - {"roomID_1/roomName_1": {
        "description": "description of the room",
        "interactables": ["interactableID", ...],
        "items": ["itemID", ...],
        "hints": ["objectID", ...],
        "imagePath": "string of the file path of the room image",
        "positions": ...the positions of each object in this room
        },

     "roomID_2/roomName_2": {...}
     }


## Mode DB
- Note: this format could be useful to BrowseRoomsDataAccessInterface
- format: JSON file
- sample DB:
  - {"QuickMode": ["roomID_1", ...],
     "StoryMode": ["roomID_#", ...],
     "TutorialMode": ["roomID_#", ...]
     }


